        <mxCell id="2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 48px;&quot;&gt;UC23&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="-2110" y="-110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3" parent="1" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#ff0000;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="40" x="-20" y="0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="1. The user goes to Account → &quot;Signed-in devices&quot;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="220" x="-110" y="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="2. The system (Auth) returns the valid sessions: device name (e.g. &quot;Chrome on Windows&quot;), location, sign-in time, last activity." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="220" x="-110" y="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="6" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="3. The system shows the current device first with the &quot;This device&quot; label, the other devices by last activity. E1, E4." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="145" width="320" x="-160" y="375" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="4. The user taps &quot;Sign out device&quot; on another device. A1, A2." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="220" x="-110" y="580" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="5. The system asks &quot;Sign out of &lt;device name&gt;?&quot;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="220" x="-110" y="715" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="9" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="6. The user confirms." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="220" x="-110" y="835" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="10" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="7. The system revokes the session, writes a revocation key in Redis, removes that row from the list and shows &quot;Signed out &lt;device name&gt;&quot;. E2, E3." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="320" x="-160" y="955" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="11" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="8. On the signed-out device, the next request is rejected (401); the client deletes the tokens and goes to Sign in with the message &quot;The sign-in session has ended on this device&quot;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="320" x="-160" y="1175" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="12" parent="1" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#ff0000;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="40" x="-20" y="1440" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="13" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E1. Only the current device → the &quot;Sign out all other devices&quot; button is hidden." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="250" x="355" y="363" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="14" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E4. The list cannot be loaded → &quot;The device list could not be loaded&quot; with a Retry button." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="250" x="355" y="468" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="15" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E2. The device is already signed out / expired or is not one's own → 404; the client shows &quot;This device has already been signed out&quot; and reloads the list." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="250" x="355" y="920" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="16" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E3. No network → &quot;Cannot connect, please try again&quot;; the other device's session does not change." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="250" x="355" y="1055" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="17" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E5. A non-Admin viewing online devices → 403." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="250" x="355" y="1193" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="18" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E6. Invalid device ID format → 400; invalid or expired token → 401." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="250" x="355" y="1283" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="19" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E7. Redis does not respond → the online signal is ignored (still returns 204); the Admin only sees the number of signed-in devices with a note." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="250" x="355" y="1373" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="20" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A1.1. The user taps &quot;Sign out all other devices&quot; and confirms." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="220" x="-510" y="685" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="21" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A1.2. The system revokes every session except the current one; the list only has &quot;This device&quot;; it shows &quot;Signed out n devices&quot;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="220" x="-510" y="810" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="22" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A2. Sign out the device in use: the &quot;Sign out&quot; button on the Account page revokes the current session (UC#01 A6)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="220" x="-910" y="685" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="23" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A3. The system signs out automatically: password reset (every device), password change (except the current device), suspension / ban (every device, UC#21), over 7 days without activity or 30 days since sign-in, reuse of an old refresh token, more than 100 sessions." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="165" width="220" x="-1310" y="1380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="24" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A4. New device alert: a sign-in on a device that never had a session → Auth publishes auth.new_device_login and Notification sends the email &quot;New sign-in on &lt;device&gt;&quot;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="220" x="-1710" y="1380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="25" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A5.1. Every client (signed in or not) sends an online signal every 60 seconds while the tab is visible or audio is playing, and sends a leave signal when the page closes. E6, E7." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="220" x="-2110" y="1380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="26" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A5.2. The Admin opens the &quot;Online devices&quot; page." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="220" x="-2110" y="1550" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="27" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A5.3. The system shows the number of devices online (signed in and visitors), accounts online, signed-in sessions, devices that visited today / in 7 / 30 days and a table of signed-in devices that are online; it refreshes every 30 seconds. E5." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="165" width="220" x="-2110" y="1660" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
